CHANGES MADE (Apache-2.0 §4(b) modification notice)
---------------------------------------------------
The original repository contained a single `harness` skill
(skills/harness/{SKILL.md, references/}). This plugin modifies and
extends it as follows:

  - Split into three skills:
      * team-harness     — domain analysis, 6 team-architecture patterns,
                           orchestrator design
      * flow-scaffolding — agent/command/skill/hook templates and generation
      * flow-validation  — 9 validation rulesets
  - Added commands: create-flow, verify-flow
  - Added docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
  - Korean localization and adaptation throughout

Version 2.0.0 (2026-10) re-synced with upstream v2.1.0 (commit 928de2c):
  - team-harness re-based on upstream skills/harness v2: three execution
    modes (Workflow orchestration / persistent named agents / sub-agent
    delegation), task-based model tiers, v1 (TeamCreate) migration path,
    error-handling and follow-up rules; local additions (verification/loop
    patterns, cross-harness orchestration, loop harness design, drift
    detection, reuse gate, create-flow/verify-flow delegation) retained
  - references: agent-design-patterns.md replaced by team-patterns.md; added
    execution-modes.md, model-selection-guide.md, workflow-recipes.md;
    remaining references 3-way merged (upstream v1 -> local -> upstream v2)
  - Added skill `evolve` derived from upstream skills/evolve, adapted to use
    git commit history as the change ledger and /verify-flow for validation
  - flow-validation / flow-scaffolding updated to v2 (opus-for-all rule and
    team-config template removed, v1 artifact detection rules added)

